],"slug":"fleet-step","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"wK3w2f8VeFHW2mPK","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685579374645,"modifiedTime":1685579379666,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.aEM2cttJ2eYcLssW","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"JCuo0kE5EStuUf4z"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/ventriloquism.webp","name":"Ventriloquism","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Whenever you speak or make any other sound vocally, you can make your vocalization seem to originate from somewhere else within 60 feet, and you can change that apparent location freely as you vocalize. Any creature that hears the sound can attempt to disbelieve your illusion.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The spell's duration increases to 1 hour, and you can also change the tone, quality, and other aspects of your voice. Before a creature can attempt to disbelieve your illusion, it must actively attempt a Perception check or otherwise use actions to interact with the sound.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"ventriloquism","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","concentrate","illusion","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"10 minutes","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"wK3w2f8VeFHW2mPK","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685579376622,"modifiedTime":1685579380970,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.yV7Ouzaoe7DHLESI","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"qw6hNYNLmpVlsisG"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/mage-hand.webp","name":"Mage Hand","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You create a single magical hand, either invisible or ghostlike, that grasps the target object and moves it slowly up to 20 feet. Because you're levitating the object, you can move it in any direction. When you Sustain the Spell, you can move the object an additional 20 feet. If the object is in the air when the spell ends, the object falls.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 2 or less.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"mage-hand","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 unattended object of light Bulk or less"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":true},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"wK3w2f8VeFHW2mPK"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"3":{"target":{"value":"1 unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less"}},"5":{"range":{"value":"60 feet"}},"7":{"target":{"value":"1 unattended object with a Bulk of 2 or less"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685579383766,"modifiedTime":1685579383766,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.pwzdSlJgYqN7bs2w","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"Tvq9FlAr2Hd0EBaX"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/produce-flame.webp","name":"Produce Flame","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A small ball of flame appears in the palm of your hand, and you lash out with it either in melee or at range. Make a spell attack roll against your target's AC. This is normally a ranged attack, but you can also make a melee attack against a creature in your unarmed reach.</p>\n<p>On a success, you deal 1d4 fire damage plus your spellcasting ability modifier. On a critical success, the target takes double damage and 1d4 persistent fire damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> Increase the damage by 1d4 and the persistent damage on a critical hit by 1d4.</p>\n<p>[[/r (@item.level)d4[persistent,fire]]]{Leveled Persistent Fire Damage}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"produce-flame","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["attack","cantrip","concentrate","fire","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":true,"formula":"1d4","type":"fire","category":null,"materials":[],"kinds":["damage"]}},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"wK3w2f8VeFHW2mPK"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"1d4"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685579384869,"modifiedTime":1685579384869,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.O9w7r4BKgPogYDDe","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"xXZPvwi4ej7e9EkP"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/tanglefoot.webp","name":"Tanglefoot","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A vine covered in sticky sap appears from thin air, flicking from your hand and lashing itself to the target. Attempt a spell attack against the target.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target gains the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe] condition and takes a -10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds for 1 round. It can attempt to Escape against your spell DC to remove the penalty and the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe] condition.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes a -10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds for 1 round. It can attempt to Escape against your spell DC to remove the penalty.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.TwtUIEyenrtAbeiX]</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The effects last for 2 rounds.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The effects last for 1 minute.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"tanglefoot","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["attack","cantrip","concentrate","manipulate","plant"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"wK3w2f8VeFHW2mPK"},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685579386246,"modifiedTime":1685579386246,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.uZK2BYzPnxUBnDjr","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"1i1YL833re6wFugv"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Somatic Flailing","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>As the summoner uses magic, the fiend lashes out at a nearby creature. The amalgamess Casts a Spell and makes a claw Strike against a creature within its reach other than the target of the spell. If the spell has an attack roll, both attacks count toward its multiple attack penalty, but the penalty doesn't increase until after it's made both of them. The amalgamess can't use Somatic Flailing again until it uses Writhing Crawl.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"cpFmy29tgxme6ztQ","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685579408959,"modifiedTime":1685579442109,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Writhing Crawl","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The amalgamess Strides up to twice, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to AC and Reflex saves against reactions triggered by this movement. The amalgamess can't use Writhing Crawl again until it uses Somatic Flailing.</p>"},"rules":[{"domain":"ac","key":"RollOption","option":"defensive-scramble","toggleable":true,"value":false}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"B3dkIIU0x9HuvorE","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"4.12.6","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685579444536,"modifiedTime":1685579527356,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685401626117,"modifiedTime":1736542899478,"lastModifiedBy":"l2rbNx2a8f5ocpeL","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"xbxXhJU9I1CaAsyP","folder":"rnSyamM9GQTIpuOo","ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"sort":10500000}